es from the bitter rivalry  that these two kingdoms are engaged in  at the beginning of the four nights of  the apocalypse manga for reasons that  are yet unknown to us as of the making  of this video king arthur changed  completely between the end of the  seventh deadly sins manga and the  beginning of the sequel manga he is now  an evil king who wants to exterminate  all the other races and clans except for  humans and because the kingdom of leonis  has a demon on its throne in the form of  meliodas and also because the onus is in  general tolerant of all the races arthur  has a special interest in destroying  leonis the seven deadly sins and the  four knights of the apocalypse our best  guess as to what happened to arthur is  that he was somehow corrupted by chaos  power but that still doesn't explain a  whole bunch of things including why  merlin continues to stay by his side  seemingly enabling his actions these big  questions will definitely be answered  eventually we just have to keep reading  the manga that said we now need to talk  about all four members of the four  knights of the apocalypse and their  powers it is important to note that at  this point in the story all four knights  are just 16 year old teenagers they  haven't coalesced into a formal group  yet and for the most part they don't  really know each other they certainly  don't have a common goal or mission and  they have no idea how or why they are  supposed to either destroy the world or  save it at some abstract point in the  future let's start with the main  protagonist of the story and the first  night of the apocalypse that we meet  right at the very beginning of the  sequel manga i'm of course talking about  percival according to the prophecy  percival is the knight of death and he  was described as a boy with verdant  wing-like hair and yes percival is a boy  with green wing-shaped hair and purple  eyes who looks like he's about 10 even  though he's actually 16. for basically  his entire life he lived on a massive  pillar-shaped mountain called god's  finger where he was raised by his  grandpa vargaze in complete isolation  from the outside world god's finger is  so tall that its tip is located above  the clouds and from the top of god's  finger you can actually see the shadow  of the sky island or sky temple which is  the home of the celestials in the  prisoners of the sky movie the  circumstances surrounding percival's  birth are extremely mysterious all we  know is that his father is a holy night  of camelot named ironside a man who  betrayed king arthur along with his  father and percival's grandfather  vargase at some point ironside  disappeared while vargazet took percival  to god's finger and raised him alone he  also told percival that his father was  dead varghese trained percival from the  age of 3 to become a strong and skilled  fighter due to the fact that he grew up  in isolation percival is extremely  curious about the outside world and once  he does finally emerge from god's finger  he is super excited about everyone and  everything that he sees because percival  has no experience socializing with  people other than his grandpa at first  he is far too naive in his social  interactions and far too trusting of  strangers now the event that triggered  percival's departure from god's finger  and the beginning of his adventure was  the death of his grandfather at the  hands of a knight in red armor who  showed up on god's finger in a floating  boat the red knight fatally wounded  vargaze and seriously wounded percival  as well before departing god's finger  right before dying percival's grandpa  reveals that the red knight is actually  ironside percival's father vargaza had  previously lied to his grandson by  telling him that his father had died  when he was very young percival  desperately wants to know why his father  would attack his grandfather in this way  but vargaze tells him that if he wants  to learn the truth he must track down  ironside and ask him varghezid then  succumbs to his injuries and a  heartbroken percival departs from god's  finger determined to bring ironside to  justice along the way perce will meet  some indispensable friends and allies  and he discovers that he possesses a  number of incredible powers and  abilities so let's talk about those  powers and abilities right now first up  we need to talk about percival's unique  magic which is called hope hope is a  type of magic that is powered by the  hope of the user's allies and by the  faith that the user's allies place in  him so it is literally the power of  friendship and as we all know the power  of friendship is the most powerful  ability in all of anime and manga  according to holy night of camelot  peligard hope could be an extremely rare  type of magic known as hero type magic  which apparently appears only in a tiny  tiny minority of people hope allows  percival to generate a magical aura  around his body or parts of his body and  he can then manipulate this aura in many  different ways the aura allows him to  defend himself by acting as a shield and  reducing the damage from enemy attacks  it also enhances his own physical  strength when he is the one doing the  attacking and it can even heal extremely  serious injuries almost instantly the  aura can also take different shapes in  order to help percival get out of tight  situations for example the aura can take  the form of wings which allows percival  to literally fly this magic can even  absorb the magic attacks of others and  shoot them right back at the attacker  and if that wasn't enough percival is  able to create a bunch of chibi clones  of himself these chibi clones have a  will of their own and they work  tirelessly to help percival if he is  ever in trouble the clones can also heal  percival's injuries and the injuries of  his allies percival possesses the  mysterious ability to instantly drain  all the fluids out of a living being  just by touching the person directly  essentially mummifying them or at least  the part of their body that percival had  come into direct contact with percival  first demonstrated this ability when he  was in a state of extraordinary  agitation and despair as he falsely  believed that all of his friends had  just been killed normal healing magic  cannot reverse the effects of this  strange mummification and only  percival's own hope magic seems capable  of reversing it it goes without saying  that hope magic is incredibly  overpowered and versatile with a huge  number of applications on and off the  battlefield on top of his extremely rare  op magic percival also possesses far  more strength and durability than an  ordinary human percival seems to have  enhanced resistance against drugs and  other types of potions and he has  exceptional lung capacity due in part to  the fact that he grew up at a very high  altitude on top of god's finger now  percival's extraordinary strength  durability and stamina could be due to  the fact that he underwent extensive  physical training since he was only  three years old but there could also be  something else going on here for  instance  percival is able to speak the language  of demons and no one seems to know why  not even percival this suggests that  percival may not be just a normal human  and that he may be of a mixed race  heritage as of the making of this video  we still don't know who percival's  mother is but i have a feeling that  merlin herself may somehow be involved  with his birth that is just speculation  on my part and i made a whole video  talking about merlin potentially being  percival's secret mother but we'll have  to wait and see what happens percival is  also currently in possession of  meliodas's former sword dragon handle  which has been repaired and turned into  a fully functioning sword by hauser  percival is able to use hope magic to  enhance the powers of the sword and as  we know dragon handle is a part of the  coffin of eternal darkness so the fact  that percival has it in his possession  is likely to become important later on  in the story now let's talk about the  second night of the apocalypse that we  meet in the story the son of bonn and  elaine lancelot according to the  prophecy lancelot is the night of war  and he is described as a mysterious boy  with no fixed appearance this is because  as a half fairy lancelot possesses the  ability to shapeshift and in fact when  we first see lancelot in the four nights  of the apocalypse manga we don't even  know that it's him because he appears as  a talking fox who goes by the name sin  get it fox's sin  anyway we actually first met lancelot in  an extra chapter of the original seven  deadly sins manga chapter  346.5 that chapter tells the story of  how at age 10 lancelot along with  jericho went missing presumably due to  the involvement of the lady of the lake  lancelot returns six years later in the  four nights of the apocalypse but he  doesn't reveal his true identity until  chapter 47 when he finally assumes a  human form we learned that lancelot is  actually in the service of the king of  leonis who is of course meliodas  lancelot is a sort of secret agent of  meliodas who has been tasked with  locating the four nights of prophecy aka  the four knights of the apocalypse and  bringing them together in leonis this is  why lancelot took such an interest in  percival and why he brought him to  leonis to meet king meliodas despite  being an incredibly strong warrior most  people have never even heard of lancelot  that is because he doesn't allow his  opponents to survive for long enough to  spread rumors about him if anyone  challenges him to a battle it will be  the last thing that he or she will ever  do that is just so freaking badass and  ruthless and to be honest taking care of  loose ends in this way makes perfect  sense for a guy whose job is to  essentially be a secret agent from  chapter 346.5  we know that lancelot had exceptional  physical strength fast reflexes and  combat capabilities even as a 10 year  old and six years later all of these  abilities have increased exponentially  lancelot is a highly skilled archer and  he uses a bow and arrow with amazing  speed and accuracy as mentioned earlier  he possesses transformation magic and it  is this magic that allows him to turn  into a fox then of course when he turns  himself into a fox he becomes a much  smaller target for his opponents on top  of that he has incredible offensive  capabilities both with his arrows and  with his bare hands he was able to  instantly kill doranok one of the holy  knights of camelot with just a single  punch to the abdomen and if that wasn't  enough lancelot can read the minds of  his opponents an ability also known as  heart reading this is yet another useful  trait that he inherited from the fairy  clan finally he has a magical ability  called shining road which allows him to  fire a beam of light at an opponent this  beam of light will then chase after its  target and follow it like a heat-seeking  missile until it finds it and destroys  it next up let's talk about tristan the  16 year old son of meliotis and  elizabeth according to the prophecy  tristan is the knight of pestilence and  he is described as a boy who has both  holiness and evil in his eyes which is a  reference to the fact that he is the son  of a demon and a goddess like lancelot  we actually met tristan in the original  seven deadly sins manga he appears as a  10 year old kid in chapter 346  which serves as the concluding chapter  of the original manga series tristan  appears again six years later in chapter  54 of the sequel manga tristan is the  prince of leones and he has an entire  order of holy nights under his command a  group of knights known as the tristan  platoon prince tristan appears to be  cool-headed and benevolent and he is  well loved by his people and his  subordinates as the son of meliotis and  elizabeth he possessed above average  physical power and fighting capabilities  since he was still a child and he has  inherited the ability to use both  goddess and demon powers from his  parents he can even manifest these two  completely different types of powers at  the same time and he can use a wide  variety of goddess and demon abilities  including incredible healing powers his  techniques tend to have the word star in  the name such as twinkling star and  healing star he also has two swords that  he uses in battle one sword is black and  the other is white interestingly enough  in one of the question corners author  nakabasuzuki revealed that tristan's two  favorite swords are named miel and  esterosa  the fourth and final knight of the  apocalypse is gawain the only female  member of the group according to the  prophecy gawain is the knight of famine  and she is described as a person who  possesses gold colored magic this gold  colored magic is none other than  sunshine the divine grace that was  originally possessed by mael and later  inherited by escanor gawain somehow  inherited the power after the tragic  death of escondor and she openly calls  herself the master of the sun she also  uses a weapon called sacred sword rita  which is a direct reference to  eskanore's divine axe rita gawain is the  niece of king arthur pendragon who of  course has been portrayed as the main  villain of the four knights of the  apocalypse series at least for now just  like eschanor when we first meet him in  his daytime form gawain is extremely  egotistical and full of herself she  refuses to listen to orders from anyone  because she believes herself to be the  strongest and so she believes that she  herself should be giving out all the  orders she also refuses to consider  herself as being in the same league as  the other three nights of prophecy since  she sees herself as superior to all of  them thanks to the power of sunshine  gawain has unbelievable physical power  and she likes to dominate her enemies  using brute force  however her moves are very basic and  predictable which proves that despite  her awesome power she is still an  amateur when it comes to combat an  experienced holy knight with superior  fighting techniques can still defeat her  which is exactly what holy night of  camelot pellegard does needless to say  gawain is nowhere near the level that  eschanor was when we first met him  because there's just no way on earth  that daytime escana would have lost to a  single holy night in battle after she  loses to peligard gawain throws a  childish tantrum and she refuses to  accept the reality of the situation  tristan is able to calm her down by  showering her with a bunch of  compliments some of which were outright  lies so despite possessing sunshine  daytime gawain is still a cocky spoiled  brat with a lot of work to do before she  can match the kind of power that escanor  once wielded she's also nowhere near as  cool as eskanor was and her one-liners  can't even compare to the true master of  the sun on top of sunshine gawain also  has other overpowered magical abilities  she is able to use strong spells like  absolute cancel to cancel out a perfect  cube and she can also use advanced  teleportation magic to instantly  teleport from one spot to another this  suggests that gawain may have had some  contact with merlin in the past  especially since we know that she is  directly related to king arthur gawain  may have even trained under merlin at  some point although this is yet to be  confirmed despite her family connection  to king arthur and camelot gawain  doesn't appear to be loyal to camelot  and in fact tristan believes that she  will fight on the side of leonis against  the forces of king arthur and that is it  all four knights of the apocalypse and  their powers explained at least in terms  of everything that we know so far  the four nights of the apocalypse manga  is still relatively new but i'll be sure  to keep you guys informed about all the  important future updates as long as you  click subscribe and hit that  notification bell right now you can also  drop a like and comment to help this  video with that youtube algorithm feel  free to follow me on twitter and  instagram at anime uproar and definitely  let me know how you're enjoying the  manga so far i want to give a big thank  you to all of our anime outpour patrons  for making videos like this one possible  special thank you to kyle salisbury this  man is an absolute mad lad and a  disciple of lord twigo himself and i  can't forget all of our the one tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including alpha sigma pate  heffa the red-haired fox hinokami and  water the toasted chi corey mcgowan the  fallen chosen orihime wukong dante  tinnell and big buddhist finally thank  you also to our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh  angel cruz alicia octor bonnie parks  fatboy games kaido might be a duck  alivania and anime s codem if you guys  enjoy our videos and you feel that they  provide value to you consider supporting  us on patreon as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys

