sessed above average  physical power and fighting capabilities  since he was still a child and he has  inherited the ability to use both  goddess and demon powers from his  parents he can even manifest these two  completely different types of powers at  the same time and he can use a wide  variety of goddess and demon abilities  including incredible healing powers his  techniques tend to have the word star in  the name such as twinkling star and  healing star he also has two swords that  he uses in battle one sword is black and  the other is white interestingly enough  in one of the question corners author  nakabasuzuki revealed that tristan's two  favorite swords are named miel and  esterosa  the fourth and final knight of the  apocalypse is gawain the only female  member of the group according to the  prophecy gawain is the knight of famine  and she is described as a person who  possesses gold colored magic this gold  colored magic is none other than  sunshine the divine grace that was  originally possessed by mael and later  inherited by escanor gawain somehow  inherited the power after the tragic  death of escondor and she openly calls  herself the master of the sun she also  uses a weapon called sacred sword rita  which is a direct reference to  eskanore's divine axe rita gawain is the  niece of king arthur pendragon who of  course has been portrayed as the main  villain of the four knights of the  apocalypse series at least for now just  like eschanor when we first meet him in  his daytime form gawain is extremely  egotistical and full of herself she  refuses to listen to orders from anyone  because she believes herself to be the  strongest and so she believes that she  herself should be giving out all the  orders she also refuses to consider  herself as being in the same league as  the other three nights of prophecy since  she sees herself as superior to all of  them thanks to the power of sunshine  gawain has unbelievable physical power  and she likes to dominate her enemies  using brute force  however her moves are very basic and  predictable which proves that despite  her awesome power she is still an  amateur when it comes to combat an  experienced holy knight with superior  fighting techniques can still defeat her  which is exactly what holy night of  camelot pellegard does needless to say  gawain is nowhere near the level that  eschanor was when we first met him  because there's just no way on earth  that daytime escana would have lost to a  single holy night in battle after she  loses to peligard gawain throws a  childish tantrum and she refuses to  accept the reality of the situation  tristan is able to calm her down by  showering her with a bunch of  compliments some of which were outright  lies so despite possessing sunshine  daytime gawain is still a cocky spoiled  brat with a lot of work to do before she  can match the kind of power that escanor  once wielded she's also nowhere near as  cool as eskanor was and her one-liners  can't even compare to the true master of  the sun on top of sunshine gawain also  has other overpowered magical abilities  she is able to use strong spells like  absolute cancel to cancel out a perfect  cube and she can also use advanced  teleportation magic to instantly  teleport from one spot to another this  suggests that gawain may have had some  contact with merlin in the past  especially since we know that she is  directly related to king arthur gawain  may have even trained under merlin at  some point although this is yet to be  confirmed despite her family connection  to king arthur and camelot gawain  doesn't appear to be loyal to camelot  and in fact tristan believes that she  will fight on the side of leonis against  the forces of king arthur and that is it  all four knights of the apocalypse and  their powers explained at least in terms  of everything that we know so far  the four nights of the apocalypse manga  is still relatively new but i'll be sure  to keep you guys informed about all the  important future updates as long as you  click subscribe and hit that  notification bell right now you can also  drop a like and comment to help this  video with that youtube algorithm feel  free to follow me on twitter and  instagram at anime uproar and definitely  let me know how you're enjoying the  manga so far i want to give a big thank  you to all of our anime outpour patrons  for making videos like this one possible  special thank you to kyle salisbury this  man is an absolute mad lad and a  disciple of lord twigo himself and i  can't forget all of our the one tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including alpha sigma pate  heffa the red-haired fox hinokami and  water the toasted chi corey mcgowan the  fallen chosen orihime wukong dante  tinnell and big buddhist finally thank  you also to our pro hero tier patrons  including the one and only gilgamesh  angel cruz alicia octor bonnie parks  fatboy games kaido might be a duck  alivania and anime s codem if you guys  enjoy our videos and you feel that they  provide value to you consider supporting  us on patreon as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

